  "body": "I name here \"not federated\" room, a room which has been created with the creation_content: {m.federate: false}. This option blocks users on other matrix homeservers from joining this room.\r\n\r\nThe `publicRooms` API should not return the not-federated rooms when the selected server is not the user's homeserver.  \r\n\r\nIt should also not return rooms which require an invite.",
